[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7165.43, "timestamp": "01:59:25", "text": "現在就是個焦慮型的人。所以，情況應該不一樣，就像我們本來應該互換一下，我的意思是，互換一下，就像生活中互換一樣。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7170.821, "timestamp": "01:59:30", "author": "@chip-t9e", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/kUzmSV9fTGltRRlDD_tgqi-V_k94_VoN8nvcWwlH6d8BXCWlBr6zHqdh8PwYTD3pJNJl3mCMeVM=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "uh I heard in Fukushima 4 people got injured.. is that true?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7179.589, "timestamp": "01:59:39", "text": "是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7183.43, "timestamp": "01:59:43", "text": "我重新聯絡上了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7186.229, "timestamp": "01:59:46", "text": "。我重新"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7189.109, "timestamp": "01:59:49", "text": "聯絡上了。是的，我們應該重歸於好。好吧，我又到公園了。我就坐下來聊聊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7191.83, "timestamp": "01:59:51", "text": "。是的，我們本來應該"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7198.629, "timestamp": "01:59:58", "text": "互換一下，就像像我這樣焦慮的人，總是過度擔心各種事情，需要那種人等等等等，對吧，比如友誼之類的，這"}]